할 수 있다. 주변에 청풍호 관광 모노레일 등 관광자원이 풍부하다.","updated":"2024-04-19","facilities":[{"k":"기타 정보","v":"개인 트레일러 입장가능","items":["개인 트레일러 입장가능"]},{"k":"글램핑 내부시설","v":"침대 · TV · 에어컨 · 냉장고 · 유무선인터넷 · 난방기구 · 내부화장실","items":["침대","TV","에어컨","냉장고","유무선인터넷","난방기구","내부화장실"]},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"캠핑장 문의","items":["캠핑장 문의"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"소형견만 가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"},{"k":"안전시설현황","v":"소화기 (8) · 화재감지기 (3)","items":["소화기 (8)","화재감지기 (3)"]}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/8845rtLFSfU8smovEb2Mjpm7.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/9966VRuox2WdZZ8XUh0mos5D.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/2863UZXe1rPj8HZvoTtJxlrr.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/34078RK9A65bfBat9GUYlAEj.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/5666Zd9PuDnZE6KD3PkiQMn4.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/0654r7SSktHvnPBZhnILefjc.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/30929yNmTkD4B3VnohA8MzJi.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/0307dCN8rIL94BqUFZpjXHPc.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/3285iq3dXYJwsIaWgF420sVl.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/81427QZqUeQgcFpBM44RxL2k.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/4974CSK0UOObA3giJaz3eLgN.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/6798waDKcU79zYbv66ic7gdF.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/7257fkoM8v98FjAiBaPDuhXs.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/7749H9rbWP8ME7IhWcqfSQ5I.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/6853UfGm0V9pR7xbAx0ujpUp.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/8266Rraa5ONTnrFWMBQpvluR.jpg"],"layout":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/100279/6346HQcU2SjgayBVEi3PTbj4.jpg"],"guide":[{"title":"오토캠핑","table":{"cols":["평상시 주중","평상시 주말","성수기 주중","성수기 주말"],"rows":[{"label":"오토캠핑","values":["50,000 ~50,000","50,000 ~50,000","0","0"]},{"label":"오토캠핑 (개인 카라반 사용 시)","values":["50,000 ~50,000","50,000 ~